	(text "Praline is a 5 V, sub-5 W USB board with a TPS62410 and 100 mA XC6206 LDOs. That budget cannot feed an OCXO, a 15 V PA, a 20 GSPS converter or a Versal. Input is USB-PD EPR 48 V at 5 A (240 W) OR a locking 48 V barrel. Typical draw is budgeted at 150 W, peak 200 W. Silent Switcher modules for the big rails, LT3045 only where the current is under 500 mA and the noise matters (clock, PLL, converter clock domain)."
		(at 20.00 16.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)))
		(uuid "c11247f1-11ac-5eaf-b99a-df592f5dcf04")
	)
