	(text "Ferrite splits of P1V0_BULK: P1V0_ADC, P1V0_ADCBK, P1V0_DAC, P1V0_DACDIG. P5V0_RF and P3V3_RF are ferrite-isolated from P5V0 and P3V3. P3V3_ALWAYS is a small LDO off the TPS26750 dead-battery path so the PD controller boots before 48 V exists. EN_* nets are ADM1266 outputs. Nothing self-starts except the PD controller."
		(at 20.00 360.00 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "d5fd5ddf-473c-5495-a2d0-f7694beb6975")
	)
